  "title": "Qt: Queue IO Graph reports during mouse moves",
  "description": "For a mouseMove event, don't immediately replot but queue\nthe replot for the next event loop iterations. This dramatically\nimproves performance on Linux where the time between mouseMoveEvents\ncan be very small. (25 microseconds.)",
